{
  "title": "Consoless System Design",
  "eyebrow": "Consoless · system design v1",
  "lead": "Go <code>api/common</code> owns every byte of data, Python makes every decision, and generated games run only on a separate play origin. <code>api/generate</code> writes the game, <code>api/verify</code> proves it runs, and the shared Kafka bus carries pointers between them. The full write-up is <code>docs/system-design.md</code>.",
  "status": "Ratified v1 · signed off 2026-10-30 (S-1 to S-15)",
