    {
      "id": "flow-generate",
      "type": "sequence",
      "title": "Prompt to playable game",
      "caption": "<strong>Nothing reaches the preview until it has run.</strong> <code>api/common</code> checks quota and creates the status row before any model call. <code>api/generate</code> writes a candidate, <code>api/verify</code> runs it with the network blocked, and only a passing candidate becomes a version. A failed check goes back to the model, up to three attempts.",
      "sequence": {
        "aria": "Sequence for one generation: the Studio posts a prompt to api/common, which checks quota, stores the prompt in compute storage, returns 202 and queues generation.requested. api/generate writes a candidate and reports generation.completed. api/common queues check.requested; api/verify bundles and runs the candidate, writes the bundle and report, and reports check.completed. api/common promotes the files and bundle and marks the generation ready; the Studio polls and then fetches a signed play URL.",
        "lanes": [
          {
            "id": "s",
            "title": "Studio",
            "sub": "browser",
            "kind": "client"
          },
          {
