    {
      "id": "flow-publish",
      "type": "sequence",
      "title": "Publish, play and score",
      "caption": "<strong>Moderation before the link goes live; the game never touches the API.</strong> Publishing queues a review in <code>api/generate</code>. Players load the game from the play CDN with a signed URL. A score goes from the iframe to the Arcade page by <code>postMessage</code>, and the page submits it with the player's own token.",
      "sequence": {
        "aria": "Sequence for publishing: the Studio asks api/common to publish; api/common queues publish.requested; api/generate moderates and reports publish.reviewed; api/common marks it live. A player opens the Arcade, gets a signed URL from api/common, loads the game in the play iframe, and the iframe posts the score to the Arcade page, which submits it to api/common.",
